ES:
{{TAG:000D:0004:04CD}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Vaya, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}, jamás me hubiera
imaginado que fueras tan atrevid{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}.
¡Menuda sorpresa, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:000D:0005:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000D:0004:04CD}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}, bu kadar pervasız biri /
olduğunu düşünmemiştim! Doğrusu
/ şaşırttın beni!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:000D:0005:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000D:0004:04CD}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}It may take some time,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} but I'll try
harder to understand you more
in the future,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:000D:0005:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000D:0004:04CD}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}Puede que tarde una temporada,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} 
pero intentaré meterme en tu papel
en el futuro,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:000D:0005:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000D:0004:04CD}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Ci potrei mettere un po',{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} ma mi
sforzerò per cercare di capirti
meglio,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:000D:0005:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000D:0004:04CD}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}Es kann ein bisschen dauern, aber
nächstes Mal versuche ich, dich
besser zu verstehen,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:000D:0005:}}
